clark: I have a missed called. It's from my neighbour Evelyn #id:41
clark: She left me a voice message #id:42
evelyn: Good evening, Clark. I haven't seen you in a while. I hope you're doing great #id:43
evelyn: Listen, this is hard to tell and I don't even know to do it. #id:44
evelyn: Leon was wandering around my house this morning. #id:45
evelyn: He saw a ball on the other side of the road. #id:46
evelyn: He ran towards it without thinking twice. #id:47
evelyn: A truck that was going by didn't see him and... #id:48
evelyn: I'm so sorry, Clark. #id:49
evelyn: I know you were so bonded together. #id:4a
evelyn: I buried the corpse myself in the backyard of my house. #id:4b
evelyn: He has some flowers. #id:4c
evelyn: If you ever need a hug or someone to talk to, here I am for you. #id:4d
evelyn: At least Claire is with you. #id:4e
evelyn: I really like this girl for you. I hope you get engaged one day #id:4f
clark: Yeah, keep dreaming. #id:50
evelyn: Again, I'm so sorry for your loss. Best wishes. #id:51
clark: Jeez, that dog only ate, pooped and barked. #id:52
clark: It's better this way. #id:53
clark: Good thing that old woman buried the corpse herself. #id:54
clark: Less work for me #id:55
clark: ... #id:56
clark: Whatever, I need to play something #id:57
clark: Today I bought my fourth game\: "SkyRise" #id:58
clark: This one looks fun but a bit challenging. I'll take it easy. #id:59
Objective\: Get at least {sky_rise_target} points in SkyRise #id:5a